---

<section id="about" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <!-- Section Title Strip -->
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4 pb-6 hairline-b mb-12">
    <div>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--accent)] font-bold">
        03 // DOSSIER
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-[var(--ink)] tracking-tight mt-1">
        ABOUT MOHD KAZIM
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)]">
      <span>[UNDERGRADUATE &amp; BUILDER]</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
    <!-- Big statement column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-[var(--ink)] leading-relaxed">
      <!-- Paragraph 1: Max 2 short sentences, 0 buzzwords -->
      <p class="font-display font-medium text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[var(--ink)] leading-snug">
        Mohd Kazim is a Computer Science undergraduate based in Lucknow, India. He builds responsive web applications with clean architecture and focused user interfaces.
      </p>

      <!-- Paragraph 2: Max 2 short sentences, 0 buzzwords -->
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--muted)]">
        I know a little of many languages and a lot about building things that work. Currently focused on the web.
      </p>

      <!-- Paragraph 3: Max 2 short sentences, 0 buzzwords -->
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--muted)]">
        I am preparing for software engineering internships and collaborative development roles. You can reach out directly via email to start a conversation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right column: Metadata table / Editorial card -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <div class="hairline bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--accent)] pb-4 hairline-b mb-6 font-bold">
          PROFILE SPECIFICATIONS
        </h3>

        <dl class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between pb-3 hairline-b">
            <dt class="text-[var(--muted)]">DISCIPLINE</dt>
            <dd class="text-[var(--ink)] font-semibold text-right">Computer Science &amp; Eng.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between pb-3 hairline-b">
            <dt class="text-[var(--muted)]">ACADEMIC LEVEL</dt>
            <dd class="text-[var(--ink)] font-semibold text-right">3rd Year</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between pb-3 hairline-b">
            <dt class="text-[var(--muted)]">LOCATION</dt>
            <dd class="text-[var(--ink)] font-semibold text-right">Lucknow, UP, India</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between pb-3 hairline-b">
            <dt class="text-[var(--muted)]">CORE FOCUS</dt>
            <dd class="text-[var(--ink)] font-semibold text-right">Algorithms &amp; Web Systems</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <dt class="text-[var(--muted)]">STATUS</dt>
            <dd class="text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold text-right">Open to Opportunities</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

